{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o130a","title":"马超等因疑曹军袭己而叛","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o130a-account","label":"正文","text":"关中诸将怀疑钟繇要袭击自己，马超、韩遂等反叛，曹仁奉命征讨；曹操命坚守勿战。","evidence":["wudi-e-o130a-q"]},{"id":"rensu-a-2cba8a034744ceef134f","label":"正文","text":"韩遂、马超之叛，弘农、冯翊多举县邑以应之","evidence":["rensu-q-a18ae77e46bc0262e5cc"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0282","role":"起兵","evidence":["wudi-e-o130a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0048","role":"起兵","evidence":["wudi-e-o130a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0283","role":"起兵","evidence":["wudi-e-o130a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0284","role":"起兵","evidence":["wudi-e-o130a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0285","role":"起兵","evidence":["wudi-e-o130a-q"]},{"person":"cao-ren","role":"征讨","evidence":["wudi-e-o130a-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"部署","evidence":["wudi-e-o130a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0181","role":"被疑","evidence":["wudi-e-o130a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"关中、潼关","evidence":["wudi-e-o130a-q"]},"time":{"label":"建安十六年","year":211,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o130a-q","wudi-q-o128","wudi-q-b-2dc1a34b174874acae8b"],"chronology":"wudi-y211","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o128","basis":"建安十六年","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,740,"O130a"],"order":310},{"id":"wudi-e-o132b","title":"曹军破关中联军","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o132b-account","label":"正文","text":"曹操约日交战，以轻兵诱战后虎骑夹击，斩成宜、李堪，韩遂马超奔凉州，杨秋奔安定。","evidence":["wudi-e-o132b-q"]},{"id":"cuimao-a-a9f6d84b658dac45725f","label":"裴注·《吴书》","text":"从破马超等娄圭功多，曹公叹子伯之计孤不及也","evidence":["cuimao-q-db2ebd12ac1479f03092"]},{"id":"cuimao-a-d288788bb672c5feee6f","label":"正文","text":"徐奕从曹操西征马超，超破军还","evidence":["cuimao-q-33453425b6eebf4ac153"]},{"id":"liusima-a-1d0c0ad7935a9c359684","label":"正文","text":"后马超反，张既从太祖破超于华阴","evidence":["liusima-q-1c8aa779ac389f7303e7"]},{"id":"lizang-a-6c59a3bb44b0108ef66f","label":"正文","text":"后数日会战大破马超等，褚身斩首级","evidence":["lizang-q-e521121329ff29a1cea8"]},{"id":